itted by            |\n| ----------------------------------------------- | --------------------- |\n| `policy`, `set` / `paused` / `removed`, spender | owner spender changes |","table":"table-3"},"182":{"id":"/contracts-52","page_id":"/contracts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/contracts#events","content":"| Topics                           | Emitted by               |\n| -------------------------------- | ------------------------ |\n| `account`, `paused` / `withdraw` | `set_paused`, `withdraw` |","table":"table-3"},"183":{"id":"/contracts-53","page_id":"/contracts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/contracts#errors","content":"`AccountPaused` (1), `UnknownSpender` (2), `SpenderPaused` (3), `PolicyExpired` (4), `InvalidAmount` (5), `ServiceNotAllowed` (6), `DuplicatePayment` (7), `OverPaymentCap` (8), `OverFrequency` (9), `OverAllowance` (10), `UnknownService` (11), `ServiceSuspended` (12), `InsufficientFunds` (13), `InvalidPolicy` (14), `UnknownRequest` (15), `RequestNotPending` (16), `RequestNotApproved` (17), `RequestExpired` (18), `PayeeChanged` (19), `NotAuthorized` (20), `NoExceptionNeeded` (21), `NotEligibleForException` (22), `AgentCannotRequest` (23), `RegistryUnavailable` (24), `NoPendingOwner` (25)."},"184":{"id":"/contracts-54","page_id":"/contracts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/contracts#service-registry","content":"| Function               | Auth | Effect                   |\n| ---------------------- | ---- | ------------------------ |\n| `__constructor(owner)` |      | Sets the registry owner. |","table":"table-4"},"185":{"id":"/contracts-55","page_id":"/contracts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/contracts#service-registry","content":"| Function                    | Auth           | Effect                                                      |\n| --------------------------- | -------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `register(id, name, payee)` | registry owner | Adds a service. Ids are never reused (`AlreadyRegistered`). |","table":"table-4"},"186":{"id":"/contracts-56","page_id":"/contracts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/contracts#service-registry","content":"| Function                   | Auth          | Effect                                      |\n| -------------------------- | ------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| `set_payee(id, new_payee)` | current payee | Rotates the payout address for the service. |","table":"table-4"},"187":{"id":"/contracts-57","page_id":"/contracts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/contracts#service-registry","content":"| Function                       | Auth           | Effect                                                                  |\n| ------------------------------ | -------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `set_suspended(id, suspended)` | registry owner | Suspends or resumes a service. A suspended service resolves to nothing. |","table":"table-4"},"188":{"id":"/contracts-58","page_id":"/contracts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/contracts#service-registry","content":"| Function                 | Auth | Effect                                                                                              |\n| ------------------------ | ---- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `resolve(id) -> Address` | none | Returns the payee. Fails with `UnknownService` or `ServiceSuspended`; there is no fallback address. |","table":"table-4"},"189":{"id":"/contracts-59","page_id":"/contracts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/contracts#service-registry","content":"| Function                     | Auth | Effect                                    |\n| ---------------------------- | ---- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `get(id) -> Option<Service>` | none | Returns `{ id, name, payee, suspended }`. |","table":"table-4"},"190":{"id":"/contracts-60","page_id":"/contracts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/contracts#service-registry","content":"| Function                 | Auth | Effect                   |\n| ------------------------ | ---- | ------------------------ |\n| `list() -> Vec<Service>` | none | All registered services. |","table":"table-4"},"191":{"id":"/contracts-61","page_id":"/contracts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/contracts#service-registry","content":"| Function                                      | Auth              | Effect                       |\n| --------------------------------------------- | ----------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| `propose_owner(new_owner)` / `accept_owner()` | owner / new owner | Two-step ownership transfer. |","table":"table-4"},"192":{"id":"/contracts-62","page_id":"/contracts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/contracts#service-registry","content":"| Function               | Auth | Effect |\n| ---------------------- | ---- | ------ |\n| `owner()`, `version()` | none | Views. |","table":"table-4"},"193":{"id":"/contracts-63","page_id":"/contracts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/contracts#service-registry","content":"Events: `service registered`, `service payee` (old and new payee), `service suspended`."},"194":{"id":"/contracts-64","page_id":"/contracts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/contracts#service-registry","content":"Errors: `NotInitialized` (1), `AlreadyRegistered` (2), `UnknownService` (3), `ServiceSuspended` (4), `NoPendingOwner` (5)."},"195":{"id":"/contracts-65","page_id":"/contracts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/contracts#building","content":"Both are standard Soroban crates. Build and deploy with the Stellar CLI (`stellar contract build`, `stellar contract deploy`) against testnet. Deploy the registry first, then the team account with the registry's address."},"196":{"id":"/","page_id":"/","type":"page","content":"Introduction","breadcrumbs":["EcoRouter Docs"],"tags":[],"url":"/"},"197":{"id":"/-0","page_id":"/","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/","content":"EcoRouter is a shared USDC spending account on Stellar for teams and their AI agents."},"198":{"id":"/-1","page_id":"/","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/#what-a-team-does-with-it","content":"What a team does with it"},"199":{"id":"/-2","page_id":"/","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/#two-ways-in","content":"Two ways in"},"200":{"id":"/-3","page_id":"/","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/","content":"EcoRouter gives a team one shared USDC account on Stellar. Every spender on that account, whether a person or an AI agent, pays under its own on-chain policy: an allowance per period, a cap per payment, a maximum number of payments, an expiry date and a list of approved services. The policy is enforced by a Soroban contract that holds the money."},"201":{"id":"/-4","page_id":"/","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/","content":"> **The agent proposes. Only the contract authorizes.**"},"202":{"id":"/-5","page_id":"/","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/","content":"An assistant or an agent can suggest a payment, and the app can pre-check it, but neither can move money on its own. The only thing that moves money is the `team-account` contract, and it runs the same checks on every payment, in the same order."},"203":{"id":"/-6","page_id":"/","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/","content":"EcoRouter runs on **Stellar testnet only** and the contracts are **not audited**. Use test funds. The sandbox runs the same rules in your browser, using a TypeScript mirror of the contract, so you can try everything without a wallet."},"204":{"id":"/-7","page_id":"/","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/#what-a-team-does-with-it","content":"**Fund one account.** The owner deposits USDC into the team account contract."},"205":{"id":"/-8","page_id":"/","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/#what-a-team-does-with-it","content":"**Add spenders.** Each person or agent gets a policy. The owner can pause or remove a spender at any time."},"206":{"id":"/-9","page_id":"/","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/#what-a-team-does-with-it","content":"**Pay registered services.** Payments go to services in the on-chain service registry, named by id, never by address."},"207":{"id":"/-10","page_id":"/","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/#what-a-team-does-with-it","content":"**Hold what breaks a rule.** A payment over a limit is held, not failed. Nothing moves until the owner approves and the payment is settled in a separate step."},"208":{"id":"/-11","page_id":"/","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/#what-a-team-does-with-it","content":"**Keep a receipt for everything.** Settled, held, declined and refused payments all show up in Activity, with a link to the Stellar transaction when one exists."},"209":{"id":"/-12","page_id":"/","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/#two-ways-in","content":"|        | Sandbox | Stellar testnet           |\n| ------ | ------- | ------------------------- |\n| Wallet | None    | Freighter, set to Testnet |","table":"table-0"},"210":{"id":"/-13","page_id":"/","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/#two-ways-in","content":"|       | Sandbox                      | Stellar testnet              |\n| ----- | ---------------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| Money | Test dollars in your browser | Test USDC on Stellar testnet |","table":"table-0"},"211":{"id":"/-14","page_id":"/","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/#two-ways-in","content":"|       | Sandbox                           | Stellar testnet                                 |\n| ----- | --------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| Rules | TypeScript mirror of the contract | `team-account` and `service-registry` contracts |","table":"table-0"},"212":{"id":"/-15","page_id":"/","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/#two-ways-in","content":"|          | Sandbox | Stellar testnet                        |\n| -------- | ------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| Receipts | Local   | Contract events with transaction links |","table":"table-0"},"213":{"id":"/-16","page_id":"/","tags":[],"type":"text"