---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `pay(spender, service, amount, memo, key) -> Receipt` | spender | Runs the checks below, transfers to the payee the registry returns, and emits a `pay` event. There is no recipient parameter. `key` is a 32-byte one-time key chosen by the caller, so a retried submission can never pay twice. |"],[191,"| Function                                      | Auth              | Effect                       |\n| --------------------------------------------- | ----------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| `propose_owner(new_owner)` / `accept_owner()` | owner / new owner | Two-step ownership transfer. |"],[150,"| Function                                  | Effect                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |\n| ----------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `set_policy(spender, input: PolicyInput)` | Creates a spender or fully replaces its policy. A new spender starts a fresh period; an existing one keeps its period, usage and pause state. Fails with `InvalidPolicy` if any limit is not positive, `max_payment > allowance`, `expires_at` is not in the future, or more than 32 services are listed. |"],[151,"| Function                              | Effect                         |\n| ------------------------------------- | ------